WEBVTT

1
00:00:08,180 --> 00:00:10,180
Brother, let me have a good time

2
00:00:10,180 --> 00:00:13,180
Are you bored or not? Let's play games.

3
00:00:14,240 --> 00:00:21,608
Feed classmates

4
00:00:21,608 --> 00:00:46,170
At any rate, I just saved your life.

5
00:00:46,170 --> 00:00:48,170
I also risked my life

6
00:00:48,170 --> 00:00:50,520
That's how you thank me

7
00:00:50,520 --> 00:00:52,520
This car seat is enough for five people to poke around.

8
00:00:52,520 --> 00:00:54,520
You told me there was no place

9
00:00:54,520 --> 00:00:59,420
I don't have time to waste time with you...

10
00:00:59,420 --> 00:01:00,420
take me

11
00:01:00,420 --> 00:01:02,420
My swordsmanship is pretty good, I can help.

12
00:01:02,420 --> 00:01:04,420
Don't worry, I'm not interested in you

13
00:01:04,420 --> 00:01:06,420
I just want to get out alive

14
00:01:06,420 --> 00:01:13,800
My name is Ji Feifan
